 your app","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/ProximityReader/adding-support-for-tap-to-pay-on-iphone-to-your-app#Display-the-Terms-and-Conditions-interface-to-the-merchant","line":25},{"title":"in-app messaging","target":"https://developer.apple.com/tap-to-pay/marketing-guidelines/#in-your-app","line":27},{"title":"An illustration of an app screen that describes the feature and contains a button labeled 'Enable Tap to Pay on iPhone'.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/a41cd2da2fc8940033e2ea6b75606197/tap-to-pay-introduction-screen%402x.png","line":29,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration of an app screen that contains a button labeled 'Try a test transaction'.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/3b8b8486581947e539f4acee1007fba4/tap-to-pay-confirmation-screen%402x.png","line":31,"embedded":true},{"title":"Educating merchants","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/tap-to-pay-on-iphone#Educating-merchants","line":37},{"title":"`ProximityReaderDiscovery`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/ProximityReader/ProximityReaderDiscovery","line":54},{"title":"Tap to Pay on iPhone marketing guidelines","target":"https://developer.apple.com/tap-to-pay/marketing-guidelines/","line":54},{"title":"An illustration of an app's Tutorials screen in Settings, with a link to open the merchant education tutorial experience.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/6e4f01e90092b71a1a173c0bdf4c9726/tap-to-pay-merchant-settings-tutorials%402x.png","line":56,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration of the Tap to Pay on iPhone merchant education tutorial sheet, which includes an image of the Tap to Pay behavior and instructions for how to accept a first payment.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/e5bab425805217aa9d34d7107b751d75/tap-to-pay-merchant-education-contactless-cards%402x.png","line":60,"embedded":true},{"title":"Checking out","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/tap-to-pay-on-iphone#Checking-out","line":77},{"title":"`prepare(using:)`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/ProximityReader/PaymentCardReader/prepare\\(using:\\","line":94},{"title":"Progress indicators","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/progress-indicators","line":96},{"title":"`PaymentCardReader.Event.updateProgress(_:)`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/ProximityReader/PaymentCardReader/Event/updateProgress\\(_:\\","line":96},{"title":"An illustration of an app screen that displays a determinate progress indicator followed by the text 'Preparing Tap to Pay on iPhone' above a purchase total.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/75c45da83b016a137a5f42a6d0df9eb7/tap-to-pay-processing-screen-determinate-progress%402x.png","line":98,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration of an app screen that displays an indeterminate progress indicator followed by the text 'Preparing Tap to Pay on iPhone' above a purchase total.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/44204349e40fe79fed0268cb77c6411a/tap-to-pay-processing-screen-indeterminate-progress%402x.png","line":100,"embedded":true},{"title":"SF Symbols","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/sf-symbols","line":106},{"title":"An illustration of a 'Tap to Pay' button containing an icon. The button correctly includes a wave symbol followed by the words 'Tap to Pay on iPhone'.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/2847ded54a90ef597b34b7ff333e47b2/tap-to-pay-on-iphone-symbol-correct%402x.png","line":108,"embedded":true},{"title":"A checkmark in a circle to indicate correct usage.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/88662da92338267bb64cd2275c84e484/checkmark%402x.png","line":110,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration of a 'Tap to Pay' button containing an icon. The button incorrectly includes the Apple logo followed by the words 'Tap to Pay on iPhone'.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/cb1cece72b73adf6bed5429864699859/tap-to-pay-on-iphone-logo-incorrect%402x.png","line":112,"embedded":true},{"title":"An X in a circle to indicate incorrect usage.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/209f6f0fc8ad99d9bf59e12d82d06584/crossout%402x.png","line":114,"embedded":true},{"title":"Additional interactions","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/tap-to-pay-on-iphone#Additional-interactions","line":118},{"title":"Displaying results","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/tap-to-pay-on-iphone#Displaying-results","line":126},{"title":"`returnReadResultImmediately`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/ProximityReader/PaymentCardReader/Options-swift.struct/returnReadResultImmediately","line":130},{"title":"progress indicator","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/progress-indicators","line":132},{"title":"`PaymentCardReader.Event.readyForTap`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/ProximityReader/PaymentCardReader/Event/readyForTap","line":132},{"title":"An illustration of an app's checkout screen showing an indeterminate progress indicator followed by the text 'Authorizing' above a purchase total.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/2088576700f5d0e5370d538a6c0c200d/tap-to-pay-authorizing-payment%402x.png","line":134,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration of an app's checkout screen showing a green checkmark in a green circle above a purchase total. Below the total is the text 'Select receipt option' followed by a stack of three buttons.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/30ad60568d0f86ea398c3b80ca642521/tap-to-pay-confirmed-payment%402x.png","line":138,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustra